{"id":"c9318ee07cf41c8b","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-left-adjoints-preserve-colimits.md","title":"Theorem — Left Adjoints Preserve Small Colimits","display":"Theorem — Left Adjoints Preserve Small Colimits","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-left-adjoints-preserve-colimits","aliases":["14-thm-left-adjoints-preserve-colimits"],"display":"Theorem — Left Adjoints Preserve Small Colimits","depends_on":["[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection]]","[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-left-adjoints-preserve-colimits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-left-adjoints-preserve-colimits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Left Adjoints Preserve Small Colimits"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c6d89bc622365e0\" href=\"?note=3c6d89bc622365e0\" title=\"14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection\">14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dad26c5de724390a\" href=\"?note=dad26c5de724390a\" title=\"14-df-identity-composite-functors\">14-df-identity-composite-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> 满足伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\dashv G\">\\(F\\dashv G\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:J\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(D:J\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是小图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q,\\kappa)\">\\((Q,\\kappa)\\)</span> 是其候选余极限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{IsColimit}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\to\\mathrm{IsColimit}_{\\mathcal D}(F(Q),(F(\\kappa_j))_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)},F\\circ D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(F,G)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{IsColimit}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,\\kappa,D)\\to\\mathrm{IsColimit}_{\\mathcal D}(F(Q),(F(\\kappa_j))_{j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)},F\\circ D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：Categorical Preliminaries，印刷页 22；DjVu 第 17 图页。对目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>，用 Hom 伴随双射把像图到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 的余锥转成原图到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GY\">\\(GY\\)</span> 的余锥，经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 唯一得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\to GY\">\\(Q\\to GY\\)</span>，再转回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FQ\\to Y\">\\(FQ\\to Y\\)</span>。双射自然性保证所有余锥方程；这也是层化保余极限的一般依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolve